@HotelOS = http://localhost:5080

### Health / info (anonymous)
GET {{HotelOS}}/

### Login as administrator  — captures the token for the calls below
# @name login
POST {{HotelOS}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin@123" }

### Token captured from the login response
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
@refresh = {{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}

### Current user
GET {{HotelOS}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Refresh the access token
POST {{HotelOS}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }

### Rooms — paged, sorted, filtered
GET {{HotelOS}}/api/rooms?page=1&pageSize=10&sortBy=number&sortDir=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rooms — only Clean rooms on floor 2
GET {{HotelOS}}/api/rooms?status=Clean&floor=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a room (Administrator / HotelManager)
POST {{HotelOS}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "number": 301, "floor": 3, "roomTypeId": 4, "nearElevator": true }

### Dashboard metrics
GET {{HotelOS}}/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List users (Administrator)
GET {{HotelOS}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a user (Administrator)
POST {{HotelOS}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "jdoe", "email": "jdoe@hotelos.local", "password": "Passw0rd!", "fullName": "Jane Doe", "roleName": "Receptionist" }

### Login as receptionist (to demonstrate RBAC — creating a user should return 403)
# @name reception
POST {{HotelOS}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "reception", "password": "Password@123" }

### Receptionist tries to create a user -> 403 Forbidden
POST {{HotelOS}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{reception.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "nope", "email": "nope@hotelos.local", "password": "Passw0rd!", "fullName": "No One", "roleName": "Receptionist" }
